  "_comment": "L0 tabular attestation pattern (Conformance §0.1, 'Attestation as a table'), shown as the JSON-LD two rows of an attestations table project to. Both rows are separate rkaf:Attestation nodes with their own identity, attestor, kind, scope, and decision time; the approved ConceptAssignment carries NO approval field, per Core §3.1 and §4.7.3. The second row is a rejection over the SAME target, which is the point of the pattern: rejection is a first-class row and is never implied by an absent one. Two attestors disagreeing about one record stays representable, which an approved_by column on the assignment could not express."
